{"title": "Carrion crawler nest", "pageid": 55911, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Carrion_crawler_nest", "categories": ["Transcripts", "Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg/300px-Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg/450px-Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg/600px-Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg/300px-Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"281\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Carrion_crawler_nest.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The carrion crawler nest</figcaption></figure>\n<p>On the south eastern end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Decrepit_Village\" title=\"Decrepit Village\">Decrepit Village</a>, at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;30&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-238</span> a peculiar hole formation can be found in a steep rocky slope.\n</p><p>If the party interacts with one of the holes, they can inspect the hole and optionally reach an arm inside:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[UNDERDARK]&nbsp;[SURVIVAL]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Inspect the holes.</i>&nbsp;(DC 15&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/30px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/40px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[SURVIVAL]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Inspect the holes.</i>&nbsp;(DC 15)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[SHORT]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Reach into one of the holes.</i></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span><i>Reach into one of the holes.</i></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>Passing the Survival check causes the interacting party member to realize the hole is from a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Carrion_crawler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"carrion crawler\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Carrion_crawler\">carrion crawler</a></span> nest, a race of centipede-like creatures that feast on dead creatures.\n</p><p>If the party member is a short-height character (or disguised as one via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/25px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/38px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/50px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disguise Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/25px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">Disguise Self</a>) and reaches into one of the holes, their hand will brush against a \"fleshy tentacle\" and a passive <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Wisdom Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> is rolled (advantage if the Survival check was passed). Passing the check earns the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Nest_Egg\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nest Egg\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Nest_Egg\" title=\"Outlander\">Nest Egg</a> inspiration event for party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/30px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/40px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Outlander\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">Outlander</a> background and a random precious gem.\n</p><p>Failing the passive check horrifies the interacting party member, and they will not try to reach into the hole again.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202012\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nC